---
import Terminal from './Terminal.astro';
---
<section class="band" aria-labelledby="sessions-title">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="sec-text">
      <h2 id="sessions-title">Real output</h2>
      <p>
        What the command line printed on a small repository: a Python file and a JavaScript file, with the
        <code>sudsy.yaml</code> shown below. <code>check</code> reports and changes nothing, <code>fix</code> applies the
        safe fixes and formats, <code>format</code> rewrites the files.
      </p>
      <p class="more"><a href="/sudsy/cli/">Every command and the JSON output</a></p>
    </div>
    <Terminal />
  </div>
</section>
